Use nested `OR` and `AND` conditions inside `findMany`:

```ts
const people = await prisma.person.findMany({
  where: {
    OR: [
      {
        OR: [
          {
            AND: [
              { age: { gt: 15 } },
              { age: { lt: 20 } },
            ],
          },
          { age: { gt: 60 } },
        ],
      },
      {
        OR: [
          {
            AND: [
              { height: { gt: 3 } },
              { height: { lt: 2 } },
            ],
          },
          { height: { gt: 6 } },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
});
```

`AND` requires all conditions in its list to be true, while `OR` matches when at least one condition is true. Note that `height > 3 AND height < 2` cannot match an ordinary numeric value; if that was a typo, adjust the bounds accordingly.

