The important correction is changing `/50` to `/50%` or `/0.5`. If you intended to style text rather than the background, use `color` instead of `background`. The supplied output uses modern `rgb(... / ...)` notation; the documented syntax establishes the 50% opacity, but the supplied evidence does not establish that Tailwind will serialize it in the exact legacy `rgba(168, 85, 247, .5)` form.

