This is expected in Tailwind CSS v4. In v3, classes inside `@layer components` or `@layer utilities` were treated as Tailwind utility classes and automatically detected. In v4, `@layer` uses native CSS cascade layers instead, so it no longer registers those classes as Tailwind utilities.

