```css
@utility btn-primary {
  background-color: var(--color-background);
  color: var(--color-foreground);
}
```

Therefore, use `@utility btn-primary` for the unused-class removal behavior you expected. Keep `@layer components` for ordinary component CSS that should remain as authored rather than be registered as a Tailwind custom utility.

