The important change is the order of the import modifiers:

```css
layer(custom) prefix(twa)
```

rather than:

```css
prefix(twa) layer(custom)
```

Using only `theme.css` and `utilities.css` also omits Preflight, so this provides the custom build described while retaining the `twa` prefix.

